				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3222223#post-3567148</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3222223/scp-343-j#post-3567148</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 08 Aug 2017 15:13:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Jukse</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1433010</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You can never truly shut the can; Wherever you go, it'll always be there. When you least expect it, it will get itself a beer, light up a cigarette and uncompromisingly waltz into the conversation:</p> <p>&quot;But you know Han shot first, right?&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
