					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3222223#post-3567141</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3222223/scp-343-j#post-3567141</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 08 Aug 2017 15:02:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>bittermixin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3085453</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Clever, but I didn't find it particularly funny. The first section of the interview in particular didn't feel over-the-top enough, so it felt less like a caricature and more like an actual argument (which&#8230; isn't very fun to read). The crossed-out expletives are something I've seen far too many times in rejected and accepted Joke articles alike, and so I didn't really crack a smile up until the interview.</p> <p>Just as an aside, I thought the 'Nuisance Level: Black' was a little unnecessary. It doesn't really add anything to the article.</p> <p>In summary: I'm not so sure about this one. No-voting for now.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
